<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Don’t Pass@𝑘: A Bayesian Framework for Large Language Model Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Experiment setup and Reproducibility</span></a>
